.pdm-build/

# Frontend build output + installed deps — regenerated by
# infra/docker/Dockerfile.nextjs (npm ci / npm run build), so shipping them in
# the backend context adds ~1.75 GB of pure waste. Source stays: the frontend
# Dockerfile COPYs nextjs-frontend/ from this same context.
nextjs-frontend/node_modules/
nextjs-frontend/.next/

